Z||000005||1FST2M6||02-14-2001||08:36 AM||||i was happy with my 4:10... it was BRUTAL with the nitrous running... my torque numbers went up on the dyno about 15lbft. but HP droped about 3. I drove the car from Atlanta to South Dakota at 80ish the entire way and it was at about 3800rpm.  I was happy with the tranny. the 3.65 that came in the car was nice but this was better. <P><BR>my $.02    you might wanna ask GT Bastard wheat he thinks about it.. he drive the car every day. (well every day it's not snowy and crappy out)||||reg||1
